# Voice Agent — Architecture Diagrams (University Admission & Student Desk)

---

## 1. High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    classDef telephony fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#1b5e20
    classDef gateway fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px,color:#0d47a1
    classDef stt fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#bf360c
    classDef llm fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4a148c
    classDef rag fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#b71c1c
    classDef tts fill:#e0f7fa,stroke:#00695c,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#004d40
    classDef storage fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#616161,stroke-dasharray:5 5,color:#424242
    classDef web fill:#fffde7,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px,color:#f57f17

    subgraph Callers ["Parents & Students"]
        Caller1([Caller A — Hindi Parent])
        Caller2([Caller B — Gujarati Parent])
        Caller3([Caller C — English Student])
    end
    class Caller1,Caller2,Caller3 telephony

    subgraph Telephony ["WebSocket Call Connection"]
        WSGateway["WebSocket Gateway / Media Gateway\n(ws://host:8765)"]
    end
    class WSGateway gateway

    subgraph Cloud ["Voice Agent Backend"]

        subgraph Pipeline ["Voice Agent Pipeline"]
            direction TB

            subgraph STT_Layer ["STT — Multi-language"]
                SarvamSTT["sarvam\n(EN · HI · GU)"]
            end
            class SarvamSTT stt

            subgraph LLM_Layer ["LLM Engine & Tool Agent"]
                Qwen["Qwen 2.5 : 3B\n(via Ollama)"]
                ToolAgent["Tool Calling Agent\n(University Desk)"]
            end
            class Qwen,ToolAgent llm

            subgraph TTS_Layer ["TTS — Multi-language"]
                SarvamTTS["sarvam\n(EN · HI · GU)"]
            end
            class SarvamTTS tts
        end

        subgraph DB_Infra ["University Database Layer"]
            PostgresDB[("PostgreSQL Database\n(Students, Marks,\nAttendance, Placements,\nAdmissions)")]
        end
        class PostgresDB storage

        subgraph RAG_Infra ["RAG Infrastructure (Docs)"]
            VectorDB[("Vector Store\n(Admission Prospectus,\nFee Structures)")]
            Embeddings["Embedding Model"]
        end
        class VectorDB,Embeddings rag
    end

    %% ===== Connections =====

    Caller1 & Caller2 & Caller3 -- "WebSockets Call Stream" --> WSGateway
    WSGateway -- "Audio Stream (16kHz PCM/WAV)" --> SarvamSTT
    SarvamSTT -- "Transcribed Text + Language Tag" --> ToolAgent

    ToolAgent -- "Query Database Tools" --> PostgresDB
    ToolAgent -- "Retrieve Policy Chunks" --> VectorDB
    ToolAgent -- "Augmented Prompt" --> Qwen

    Qwen -- "Spoken Text Response" --> SarvamTTS
    SarvamTTS -- "Synthesized Audio Stream" --> WSGateway
    WSGateway -- "Audio Response Stream" --> Caller1 & Caller2 & Caller3
```

---

## 2. Call Interaction Flow — Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Parent as Parent / Student
    participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
    participant STT as STT (sarvam)
    participant Agent as LLM Agent (Qwen 2.5:3B)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant TTS as TTS (sarvam)

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Parent, WS: Phase 1 — WebSocket Call Connection
        Parent->>WS: Connect via ws://host:8765
        WS-->>Parent: Connection Established
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Parent, STT: Phase 2 — Speech Recognition
        Parent->>WS: Send Audio Stream (PCM / WAV)
        WS->>STT: Forward Audio Stream
        STT->>STT: Transcribe Audio & Detect Language (HI / GU / EN)
        STT-->>Agent: Transcribed Text ("Check marks for Aarav Patel")
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Agent, DB: Phase 3 — Tool Calling & DB Querying
        Agent->>Agent: Determine Tool Call: lookup_student("Aarav Patel")
        Agent->>DB: Query Student ID
        DB-->>Agent: Returns Student Record (ID: STU101)
        Agent->>Agent: Determine Tool Call: get_student_marks("STU101")
        Agent->>DB: Query Marks & Grades
        DB-->>Agent: Returns Subject Marks (DSA: 88, DBMS: 92, OS: 79)
        Agent->>Agent: Generate Natural Spoken Answer
    end

    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over Agent, Parent: Phase 4 — Speech Synthesis & Audio Delivery
        Agent->>TTS: Text Response + Language Code (hi-IN / gu-IN / en-IN)
        TTS->>TTS: Synthesize Audio Chunks
        TTS-->>WS: Return Audio Bytes
        WS-->>Parent: Stream Audio Response to Caller
    end
```
